ver defaults to serving `index.html`, which explains the `<title>` detection! This is crucial because it means the error handling is working as expected when the server sends an HTML page as an error response, but not when it sends an error as JSON. My next step will be to explore why I\'m receiving HTML pages in the error cases, as that does not line up with the expected JSON responses.\n\n\n"
